/Users/d111879/Documents/Project/DEMO/Student/Student_mobile/sapp/research/legacy_type_runs/legacy-types-20260927-retry/batch_041/logs/legacy-452.jsonl:11:{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'curl --insecure -fsSL --max-time 20 https://www.iitk.ac.in/institute | rg -in -o \".{0,160}(Institute of National Importance|autonomous|Act of Parliament|Indian Institute of Technology|IIT Kanpur|institution).{0,240}\" | head -40'","aggregated_output":"5:<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Established in 1959, the Indian Institute of Technology, Kanpur, stands as a distinguished institution founded by the Government of India. Know more.\" />\n6:<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur, About iitk, iit kanpur\" />\n8:<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Institute | IIT Kanpur\" />\n11:<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Institute | IIT Kanpur\" />\n24:\t\t\t<title>About IIT Kanpur | Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur</title>\n1054:\t\t\t\t<h1>About IIT Kanpur</h1>\n1056:\t\t\t\t<p><span>Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur, established in 1959,</span> is a premier institution established by the Government of India. As one of the first-generation IITs, IIT Kanpur continues to make unparalleled academic contributions to teaching, research, and innovation, maintaining a synergy between fundamental and applied rese\n1064:esearch, distinctive and effective teaching, and meaningful contributions to knowledge creation in a variety of disciplines. Educating and nurturing leaders of institutions and entrepreneurial organizations and supporting them in their efforts to create high-quality talent and value.</p><p>Impacting the world of science and technology education and research through continuous engagement with alumni and promi\n1118:\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Prof. Manindra Agrawal,</strong> currently serving as the Director of the Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur, is a renowned computer scientist, globally known for his contributions in Complexity Theory and Cryptography.</p><p>He received his BTech and PhD in Computer Science and Engineering from IIT Kanpur in 1986 and 1991, respectively. H\n1118:tion, Chennai, and as a Humboldt Fellow at the University of Ulm, Germany, before joining as a faculty in the Department of Computer Science and Engineering at IIT Kanpur in 1996.</p>\n1145:\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>The History of IIT Kanpur</h3>\n1148:\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>IIT Kanpur's history is marked by a commitment to excellence, innovation, and a dedication to shaping India's future through education and research.</p>\n1201:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>IIT Kanpur's rich cultural diversity and vibrant sports culture provide students with a well-rounded and enriching educational experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n1221:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These awards underscore IIT Kanpur faculty's commitment to advancing knowledge, fostering innovation, and mentoring future leaders in their field.</p>\n1256:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>IIT Kanpur is dedicated to achieving the highest standards of excellence in all its endeavors. This commitment to excellence applies to academic programs, research, faculty, and the overall educational experience it provides to students.</p>\n1278:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>IIT Kanpur fosters a culture of innovation and encourages creative thinking, problem-solving, and entrepreneurship among its students and faculty. It aims to be at the forefront of technological advancements and research.</p>\n1289:stitute values diversity in its student body, faculty, and staff, recognizing that a diverse and inclusive environment enhances learning and research outcomes. IIT Kanpur is committed to providing equal opportunities for all.</p>\n1314:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>IIT Kanpur provides a nurturing and supportive atmosphere for its faculty and staff, ensuring their holistic development.&nbsp;</p>\n1316:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>IIT Kanpur provides a nurturing and supportive atmosphere for its faculty and staff, ensuring their holistic development.</p>\n1343:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Kanpur Indo-American Programme (KIAP) at IIT Kanpur was established in 1962 with the objective of fostering close collaboration with the global community and staying abreast of the dynamic real...\n1345:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Kanpur Indo-American Programme (KIAP) at IIT Kanpur was established in 1962 with the objective of fostering close collaboration with the global community and staying abreast of the dynamic realm of science and technology. Under this programme, the Institute received technical assistance thr\n1345:ough KIAP from a consortium of nine leading institutions of U.S.A during 1962-1972. The institutions are listed below:</p><ul><li>California Institute of Technology</li><li>Carnegie Institute of Technology</li><li>Case Institute of Technology</li><li>Massachusetts Institute of Technology</li><li>Ohio State University</li><li>Princeton Un\n1363:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>IIT Kanpur’s rising global stature is credited to its charismatic alumni whose stupendous achievements in myriad fields continue to make us proud.\r\n1408:\t\t\t\t\t<h4>To find out how the experts at IIT Kanpur can help you succeed more.</h4>\n1545:            <div><p>Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur<br>Kalyanpur, Kanpur -208 016</p><p><a href=\"tel:05122594999\"><strong>Contact Number:</strong></a><br><a href=\"tel:05122590151\">0512 - 259 - 0151</a></p><div class=\"allnumbers\"><p><strong>Emergency Numbers:</strong></p><div class=\"w\n1584:\t\t\t\t\t\tIndian Institute of Technology Kanpur</p>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
