/Users/d111879/Documents/Project/DEMO/Student/Student_mobile/sapp/research/legacy_type_runs/legacy-types-20260927-retry/manifests/batch_041.json:249:      "description": "Delhi Technological University (DTU), formerly Delhi College of Engineering, is one of India's largest and most reputed state technical universities, established in 1941, offering B.Tech., M.Tech., MBA, and Ph.D. programs. It is consistently ranked among the top 15 engineering institutions in India and is particularly known for its electronics, computer science, and mechanical engineering programs. DTU's location in the national capital provides exceptional industry access, and its graduates are well placed in IT, consulting, PSUs, and startups.",
